// SOURCE: examples/gpu/mandelbulb/main.vl
// REQUIRES: metal
// LINK: std::gpu and std::window name the frameworks they link
// Half-resolution ray marching into the same output surface, exercising
// the dynamic-resolution film and the bilinear upscale pass.
// ARGS: --headless --scale 0.5 --size 96x64 --frames 2 --out mandelbulb-scale-test.ppm
// EXPECT: mandelbulb 96x64, power 8, 2 frames
// EXPECT: wrote mandelbulb-scale-test.ppm
// EXPECT: render ok
// EXPECT: deterministic ok
// EXPECT-PPM: mandelbulb-scale-test.ppm tests/golden/gpu-mandelbulb-scale.ppm region 24,8,48,48 tolerance 12 allow 3%
